	('They look the same, but they act differently','Họ trông giống nhau nhưng lại cư xử khác nhau','00:00:03.560','00:00:07.140','esl-fast-elementary-1-6'),
	('Jill likes sports','Jill thích thể thao','00:00:08.160','00:00:09.580','esl-fast-elementary-1-6'),
	('She is good at basketball and golf','Cô ấy giỏi bóng rổ và chơi golf','00:00:10.320','00:00:12.620','esl-fast-elementary-1-6'),
	('She is also loud','Cô ấy cũng rất ồn ào','00:00:13.340','00:00:15.100','esl-fast-elementary-1-6'),
	('She talks all day','Cô ấy nói chuyện suốt cả ngày','00:00:15.820','00:00:17.800','esl-fast-elementary-1-6'),
	('Jodi likes reading','Jodi thích đọc sách','00:00:18.880','00:00:20.100','esl-fast-elementary-1-6'),
	('She can read 300 pages a day','Cô ấy có thể đọc 300 trang mỗi ngày','00:00:20.900','00:00:23.700','esl-fast-elementary-1-6'),
	('She is also quiet','Cô ấy cũng rất trầm lặng','00:00:24.340','00:00:26.020','esl-fast-elementary-1-6'),
	('She does not like to talk','Cô ấy không thích nói chuyện','00:00:26.820','00:00:28.360','esl-fast-elementary-1-6'),
	('Jill and Jodi still love each other','Jill và Jodi vẫn yêu thương nhau','00:00:28.880','00:00:31.660','esl-fast-elementary-1-6');
